      "moduleId": "rn_qnHfMCqJR5qgzS3S::L2",
      "stem": "Explain why one chromosome of each pair comes from each parent.",
      "misconceptionClass": "mechanism reasoning",
      "kind": "explain-why",
      "modelAnswer": "Fertilisation fuses one haploid gamete from each parent, so every homologous pair assembles from one maternal and one paternal chromosome.",
